WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.469
On Sunday morning, the whole service runs from one laptop, offline.

2
00:00:06.569 --> 00:00:12.021
Changes are saved as you go, so Lampstand can pick up after a crash.

3
00:00:12.121 --> 00:00:16.406
Updates never install while something is on air.

4
00:00:16.506 --> 00:00:19.477
Back up your Lampstand folder, and you are covered.
